== Effects ==
* Isaac fires a spread of three tears at once.
* {{Dlc|nr}} Tears down: (Delay * 2.1) + 3
* {{Dlc|r}} Tears fired per second * 0.51.

== Notes ==
* The maximum number of tears per volley that can be reached by combining and/or duplicating {{i|20/20}}, The Inner Eye, {{i|Mutant Spider}} and {{i|The Wiz}} is 16. Additional inner eyes widen the spread of the 16 tears up to a semicircle around isaac.
* {{dlc+|r+}} The Inner Eye's quality is treated as 2 for the purposes of {{I|Bag of Crafting}}.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc|anr}} {{I|20/20}}: Shoots 5 tears with no further decrease in fire rate. 
** {{dlc|r}} Removes the fire rate penalty while reducing damage to 80%. Additional copies will add one additional tear with no further change to damage/fire rate.
* {{I|Abyss}}: When Isaac uses Abyss to absorb The Inner Eye it creates three locusts instead of one.
* {{i|Cursed Eye|nr}}: At full charge, fires 3 rows of 4 tears, resulting in 12 tears.
** {{dlc|r}} At full charge, fires 3 rows of 5 tears, resulting in 15 tears.
* {{i|Doctor's Remote}} / {{i|Epic Fetus}}: Replaces the single missile strike with a barrage of three consecutive missiles.
* {{i|The Inner Eye|anr}}: Effects stack, resulting in 6 tears being shot with no further decrease in fire rate.
** {{dlc|r}} Adds an additional tear with no further decrease in fire rate. This can be stacked up to 16 tears. 
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}: The tear gains two orbiting tears.
* {{i|Mom's Knife}}: 3 knives are fired.
* {{dlc|anr}} {{i|Mutant Spider}}: Shoots 7 tears instead of 3. No further decrease in fire rate.
** {{dlc|r}} Shoots 5 tears instead of 3. Decreases fire rate by a little.
* {{i|Polyphemus|nr}}: Tear rate is not lowered further. Damage is increased by a flat +5 instead of a normal Polyphemus boost.
** {{dlc|r}} Damage is increased by a flat +5 instead of a normal Polyphemus boost. Decreases fire rate by a little.
* {{i|Tractor Beam}}: All tears are fired along the beam, but some may be hard to see as they overlap each other.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|20/20|na}}: Overridden by The Inner Eye.
* {{i|Brimstone}}: Fires 3 beams. Affects Azazel's short-ranged '''Brimstone''' similarly.
* {{C|The Forgotten|a+}}: Triples bones thrown and swung. Significant decrease in fire rate.
* {{C|Keeper|anr}}: Fires 6 tears with significantly decreased fire rate.
** {{dlc|r}} Fires 4 tears with significantly decreased fire rate.
* {{c|Tainted Keeper|r}}: Only fires 5 tears in the volley, while still gaining significantly decreased fire rate.
* {{i|Kidney Stone}}: Increase number of tears in tear barrage; however, only fires one stone.
* {{i|Lead Pencil}}: The barrage will activate as normal but Isaac will sometimes fire red tears.
* {{i|Loki's Horns}}: Only occasionally fires one tear in the other three directions.
* {{i|Mom's Eye}}: Only occasionally fires one tear out of the back of Isaac's head.
* {{i|Mutant Spider|na}}: Overrides The Inner Eye.
* {{i|Monstro's Lung}}: Adds 5 tears to barrage with a significant decrease in fire rate.
* {{i|Sad Bombs}}: Does not affect the number of tears when bombs explode.
* {{i|Technology 2}}: The laser is not affected by The Inner Eye.
* {{i|Varicose Veins}}: No effect on number of tears when taking damage.

